---
---

<section id="pricing" class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Predictable infrastructure tiers</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600">Start on the free edge tier and scale when your traffic demands multi-region routing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">For solo builders</p>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Starter</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">$0<span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-500">/mo</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li>Unlimited static Astro builds</li>
          <li>GitHub automated deployments</li>
          <li>100 GB monthly edge bandwidth</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
          Get Started
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 p-8 text-white">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-orange-400">For shipping teams</p>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Production</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-3xl font-bold">$29<span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">/mo</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li>Preview URLs on every pull request</li>
          <li>Cloudflare Pages &amp; Vercel webhooks</li>
          <li>1 TB monthly edge bandwidth</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-lg bg-orange-600 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors">
          Launch Production
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">For organizations</p>
        <h3 class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Enterprise</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Custom</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li>Dedicated edge compute zones</li>
          <li>SAML SSO &amp; audit trails</li>
          <li>99.99% contractual uptime SLA</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="mt-8 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
          Contact Engineering
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
